            "concept": "the Obsidian Flames expansion",
            "ground_noun": "dark grass",
            "lighting": "Low orange sunlight cuts through cool charcoal cloud layers.",
            "rendering": "Use bold trading-card linework, restrained firelight accents, deep charcoal greens, and clear atmospheric separation.",
